<title>USA: Apple South Inc EPS before charges slips.</title>
<headline>Apple South Inc EPS before charges slips.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Ga. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED		  Dec 29, 1996	Dec 31, 1995</p>
<p> Sales				     $ 142,948	  $ 122,003</p>
<p> Net earnings				  6,197		  992</p>
<p> EPS before charges			  $0.17		$0.20</p>
<p> Net Earnings per share			.16*		.02**</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	     38,629	     40,098</p>
<p> TWELVE MONTHS ENDED		Dec 29, 1996	Dec 31, 1995</p>
<p> Sales					 546,022	    440,190</p>
<p> Net earnings				 11,674	     20,279</p>
<p> EPS before charges			  $0.75		$0.73</p>
<p> Earnings per share			   .30*		.52**</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	     39,368	     38,880</p>
<p>		   (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: * 1996 Q4 EPS $0.17 and 1996 year EPS $0.75 before after-tax charges for asset revaluation. Q4 charges were $375,000 or $.01. Year charges were $17.8 million or $0.45.</p>
<p>** 1995 Q4 EPS was $.20 and 1995 year EPS was $0.73 before after-tax charge of $6.9 million or $.18 per share in the fourth quarter and $8.2 million or $.21 per share for the year.</p>
</text>
